<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How TechOrbit handles visitor information.">
  <p>Last updated: 17 November 2026</p>
  <p>This page explains what information TechOrbit collects when you visit the site. We aim to collect as little as possible.</p>
  <h2>What we collect today</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not ask you to create an account.</li>
    <li>We do not currently run advertising, analytics or a newsletter.</li>
    <li>If you choose dark or light mode, your choice is saved in your own browser (local storage) so the site remembers it. It is not sent to us.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Hosting and technical logs</h2>
  <p>TechOrbit is hosted on Cloudflare. Like most web hosts, Cloudflare may process technical data such as your IP address and browser type to deliver the site and keep it secure. See Cloudflare's own privacy policy for details.</p>
  <h2>Changes in the future</h2>
  <p>We may add services such as site analytics, advertising (for example Google AdSense) or an email newsletter. If we do, this policy will be updated first to explain what data is collected, which cookies are used and how you can opt out, and we will ask for consent where the law requires it.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Our articles link to other websites. We are not responsible for how those sites handle your information.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>TechOrbit is a general-audience site and is not directed at children under 13.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, use our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
